Date: Thu, 16 Jan 2025 17:14:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] [SPARK-49907][ML][CONNECT][FOLLOW-UP] Move pyspark.ml.remote
 to pyspark.ml.connect

### What changes were proposed in this pull request?

This PR is a retry of https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/49522 that refactors pyspark.ml.remote to pyspark.ml.connect

### Why are the changes needed?

To move the connect code into one place.

### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?

No.

### How was this patch tested?

Existing tests should cover

### Was this patch authored or co-authored using generative AI tooling?

No.

Closes #49524 from HyukjinKwon/ml-rename.

